      "writtenOn": "2019-07-22T23:44:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This would be board specific. For chrome OS devices, nothing needed; cr50 would also detect this case and assert CCD_MODE_ODL.\n\nBut for debug devices like servo_v4, servo_v4 may want to determine the orientation and configure the SBU mux.",
