      "writtenOn": "2019-07-22T23:44:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Again, it\u0027s likely board specific. Cr50 does the detection for us and drives CCD_MODE_ODL which configures the SBU bypass hardware.\n\nHmm, but actually I heard there were rumors of putting the PPC in front of cr50, so it might require the EC to configure the SBU FETs for the PPC.\n\nSo yeah, board specific. We can cross that bridge once we get to it though.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1315,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 1319,
        "endChar": 0
      },
      "revId": "e72dd1a8c97daa4010553fe51175472c4cccd230",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
